  "description.fluxnautics.anti_grav": "This machine projects a powerful flux field around the ship its placed on and negates effects of gravity upon it. The strength of the effect can be controlled. (Note: due to limitations of Sable if something is keeping the sublevel awake it will slowly drift downwards still, there's no fix for this currently.)",
  "description.fluxnautics.cloak_generator": "Was that a bird?",
  "description.fluxnautics.conduit_connector": "What if rope but make it Sci-Fi??",
  "description.fluxnautics.conduit_port": "You've got a rope now but what if you want to make it useful for transferring stuff from here to there?",
  "description.fluxnautics.daemon_protocol": "[WIP] Companion drone turned into a protector of home.",
  "description.fluxnautics.decloaker": "Negates cloaks generated by Cloak Generators you own.",
  "description.fluxnautics.field_drive": "Generates a localized warp field that can be used to travel large distances momentarily.",
  "description.fluxnautics.field_manipulator_unit": "Allows for remote manipulation of gravity fields.",
  "description.fluxnautics.forcefield_emitter": "Turn it on and nothing will get to you.",
  "description.fluxnautics.forcefield_harmonizer": "Items in the filters will each consume FE per tick and provide a safe passage through forcefields that use matching items.",
  "description.fluxnautics.inertia_dampener": "An inertia dampener that allows for a powerful braking system.",
  "description.fluxnautics.ion_thruster": "A thruster that uses ion propulsion to provide controlled thrust, must be placed in a thruster array. Right interaction to see multiblock metadata.",
  "description.fluxnautics.quantum_lock": "A tether generator that creates a new physics object, and subsequently allows for telescopic and angular movement of it. Breaks blocks and damages entities that touch the tether.",
  "description.fluxnautics.quantum_pull_unit": "Pulls in nearby items and stores them in bound QIO frequency.",
  "description.fluxnautics.spatial_anchor": "What happens when an unstoppable force meets an immovable object?",
  "description.fluxnautics.stabilizer": "Who said keeping things stable has to be complicated? Now with directional vectoring",
  "description.fluxnautics.swarm_unit": "Creates smaller Meka-Robits that follow the main one, two for each installed upgrade.",
  "description.fluxnautics.thruster_array_alignment": "Alignment cores adjust all thrust force sources of the entire array by 1 block in their respective axis closer to the center of mass, allowing for easier alignment of larger arrays.",
  "description.fluxnautics.thruster_array_booster": "A booster for a thruster array, each booster increases the maximum output of each Ion Thruster by a set amount.",
  "description.fluxnautics.thruster_array_controller": "A controller for a thruster array, each array must have a controller in order to function. While default group is in analog mode it will accept a redstone signal to control the default group.",
  "description.fluxnautics.thruster_array_structural": "A structural component for a thruster array, does nothing by itself but allows you to build out a larger array without adding boosters, thrusters or subcontrollers. Also serves as a base component to all thruster array crafting.",
  "description.fluxnautics.thruster_array_subcontroller": "A subcontroller for a thruster array, can be tuned to specific group, while in analog mode will accept redstone signal to control tuned group. Use a Configurator to tune groups.",
  "entity.fluxnautics.meka_robit": "Meka-Robit",
